1327517526083046", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628882_1327517529416379_6882822583030067814_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=51H5_KZPRKwQ7kNvwF0Br-n&_nc_oc=Adpetujgizyzj9xf24Kk8-rNRK0cZ_7Afb8dmDCpVKydsll7w6HHWNAl1Zh9o17FGVk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPLDvdB-qq0nXBExrs_UI64X1SoxGfUxwfyq8Pvrs5NlQ&oe=6ADE01BD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape-2560x1440.png", "id": "1481305757379362", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628875_1481305760712695_2995580032871028984_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q7Oo_2DAa5MQ7kNvwGZw5Mm&_nc_oc=AdrayEr9x34Ieco9Gn5ZMb49m7d_af-vzc_SepTHW2LgGXF_S4pBX4a73a59Qugw5Ng&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMzSEo6Ek7hjB2p_DB5uzFrw_XGs0B4OWBtSnQ4NhByjQ&oe=6ADE17AD"}, "display_name": "MitoRush", "keywords": ["fitness", "rhythm", "boxing", "workout", "cardio"], "long_description": "**Move to the beat. Bring your people.**\n\nMitoRush\u2122 turns music into a workout. Crystals fly at you on the beat; you hit them with your hands, dodge, duck, and \u2014 when you choose \u2014 kick and sprint. Two ways to play:\n\n- **Flow** \u2014 full-body movement to the music.\n- **Boxing** \u2014 punches and stances; tracks can call a stance change mid-song.\n\n**Your body, your settings.** Four difficulties. A five-step *Targets* ladder from hands-only to everything. Seated play. A calibration that places targets for your height and reach. Pair a Bluetooth heart-rate monitor and your effort shows on the results screen \u2014 never on a leaderboard.\n\n**Studio: live classes with voice.** Create a studio for your gym, family, or friends. A host starts a class, everyone plays the same beats at the same time, and you can talk while you sweat. Drop into a class with a six-character code. Studio members can author beatmaps in the web Choreographer and publish them for everyone.\n\n**Keep score.** Personal records, league boards ranked by minutes and points, and a recap after every session.\n\nMitoRush\u2122 is available as a **Solo** subscription (all solo play and the full library) or **Studio** (everything in Solo plus live classes and authoring). Billed through Meta; cancel any time from your Meta subscriptions.\n\nNot a medical device. Consult a professional before starting any exercise program.", "short_description": "MitoRush\u2122 is rhythm fitness in VR. Hit crystals to the beat \u2014 Flow for full-body movement, Boxing for punches and stances \u2014 at four difficulties, standing or seated, with a targets ladder from hands-only up to kicks and lightning steps. Play solo through a growing track library, or join live Studio classes: a host starts, everyone plays the same beats together, voice included. Pair a Bluetooth heart-rate monitor to see your effort. Solo and Studio subscriptions."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mitorush.net/legal/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://mitorush.net/legal/terms", "publisher_name": "Technical Media LLC", "support_website_url": "https://mitorush.net/legal/data-deletion", "website_url": "https://mitorush.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "26624742183878253"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": 